.SH PORTABILITY
X/Open Curses Issue\ 7 (2009) does not specify this command.
.PP
SVr4 systems provide
.I \%captoinfo
as a separate application from
.IR \%tic "."
Its
.B \-v
option does not accept a trace level argument
.IR n ;
repeat
.B \-v
.I n
times instead.
.PP
NetBSD does not provide this application.
